@startuml Pathsnap_Pipeline_Target
title Recommended Pathsnap data pipeline (Kota Bandung)
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

start
:Overpass harvest\n(nwr + out center, Kota Bandung boundary);
note right: friend's Phase 1, fixed to include ways/relations
:Store untouched JSON\n**raw_scraped_items**;
:Deduplicate\n(google_place_id, or name similarity + ST_DWithin 50 m);
:Enrich with real ratings, review count,\nprice, opening hours\n(Google Places API / licensed data);
note right: replaces the hardcoded mock metrics
:Proxy filter\nrating >= 4.4 and reviews < 150\n(friend's Phase 4);
:Gemini extraction (server-side)\nstructured JSON: summary, vibe,\nhidden_gem_score, confidence\n-> **ai_extractions**;
if (confidence >= threshold?) then (yes)
  :Auto-approve;
else (no)
  :Manual review queue\n(needs_review = true);
endif
:Promote into **places**\n+ assign district via ST_Covers;
partition "Accommodations (not covered yet)" {
  :Harvest tourism=hotel|guest_house|hostel|\napartment|chalet from OSM;
  :Enrich price per night, rating,\nstar class, amenities;
  :Promote into **accommodations**;
}
stop
@enduml
